   "updated": 1764000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY NOT AN 'AUDIO AI'?\n\nSpeech-to-speech AI is built for one person, loses\nwho said what, hides mistakes, ties us to one\nprovider, gives no transcript, costs ~10x more.\nEvery real group-meeting product uses a pipeline.",
   "originalText": "WHY NOT AN 'AUDIO AI'?\n\nSpeech-to-speech AI is built for one person, loses\nwho said what, hides mistakes, ties us to one\nprovider, gives no transcript, costs ~10x more.\nEvery real group-meeting product uses a pipeline.",
   "fontSize": 15,
